  "title": "Vibrant Savory Brazilian Red-Curry-Paste Tagine",
  "description": "A savory, crispy, festive Brazilian dish featuring red-curry-paste, perfect for the holiday season. Serve over rice or with naan bread for a satisfying meal.",
