  "instructions": [
    "Preheat your oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a large ceramic tagine, heat the coconut oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion, garlic, and ginger, and cook until the onion is translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the red curry paste and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the red bell pepper, carrots, and potatoes, and cook for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Pour in the coconut milk and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Transfer the tagine to the preheated oven and bake for 30 minutes, or until the vegetables are tender and the sauce is thick and bubbly.",
    "Garnish with chopped cilantro and serve over rice or with naan bread.",
    "Let the dish rest for 10 minutes before serving to allow the flavors to meld together."
  ],
